  m_text: "== Rules ==\n\u25A0 Each round, choose whether to run over someone or
    not\n  \u2192 Each option has assigned roles and the number of people assigned
    to it\n  \u2192 As rounds progress, the \u201Croles\u201D and \u201Cnumber of
    people\u201D become unknown.\n\n\u25A0 The Guilt% and inheritance set for the
    option you chose will be added.\n\n\u25A0 Each choice incurs a toll fee.\n  \u2192
    Toll fees increase with each round.\n\n\u25A0 Receive a salary each round\n 
    \u2192 Salary = 12 gold\n\n\u25A0 Use accumulated money to purchase items.\n 
    \u2192 Purchased items go into your inventory and can be used.\n  \u2192 Permanent
    items remain active while in your inventory."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
